Scope / 适用范围

This license covers only the original work in this project: the C++ sources,
the PvP rule sources (tools/pvp72_sources), the decompiler, translators, test
and build tools, and the documentation written for this project.

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights to:
  - code decompiled from the original PVZ-Rouge game (extract/original,
    extract/live) and the game's original data, which belong to their
    original authors;
  - Plants vs. Zombies names, images, music and sounds, which belong to
    PopCap Games / Electronic Arts;
  - third-party libraries under third_party/ (SDL2, SDL2_image, SDL2_mixer,
    SDL2_ttf, nlohmann/json, zlib), which keep their own licenses.

本许可只适用于本项目自己编写的部分（C++ 源码、PvP 规则源码、反编译器、翻译与
测试/构建工具、项目文档）。原版肉鸽游戏的反编译代码与数据归原作者；植物大战
僵尸的名称、图片、音乐与音效归 PopCap Games / Electronic Arts；third_party/ 下
的第三方库沿用各自的许可。
